    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cards and Guns is a top-down arena shooter roguelite, where you\u2019ll have to defeat hordes of creatures. Choose from a variety of cards and upgrades to create unique builds and survive to the end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Auto-firing weapons by default with a manual aiming option</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three game modes: classic, survivors and infinite</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new cards, characters and power ups</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect materials to get cards and upgrades from the shop</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless replayability</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >World ranking</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accessibility options</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THREE GAME MODES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic mode:</strong> Survive waves lasting 20 to 100 seconds each and kill off as many creatures as you can during that time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2329160/extras/33e3a70040d48c0841bffc958acc0f1d.avif?t=1728637025\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survivors mode:</strong> Survive for 40 minutes as you fight relentless hordes consisting of hundreds and thousands of monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2329160/extras/abb81e9dcab36cf3e09b4d2f5754327a.avif?t=1728637025\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Infinite mode:</strong> Survive as long as you can while fighting relentless hordes of hundreds and thousands of monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2329160/extras/ffd44f650486fe6399a9afc5aec5ab49.avif?t=1728637025\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DYNAMIC BUILDS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different characters, cards and upgrades to choose from, no two attempts will ever be the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2329160/extras/97f3614c63fe6d56918268c75cb1b999.avif?t=1728637025\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ENDLESS REPLAYABILITY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cards and Guns offers endless replayability! Test your skills and improve your score!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cards and Guns is a top-down arena shooter roguelite, where you\u2019ll have to defeat hordes of creatures. Choose from a variety of cards and upgrades to create unique builds and survive to the end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Auto-firing weapons by default with a manual aiming option</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three game modes: classic, survivors and infinite</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new cards, characters and power ups</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect materials to get cards and upgrades from the shop</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless replayability</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >World ranking</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accessibility options</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THREE GAME MODES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic mode:</strong> Survive waves lasting 20 to 100 seconds each and kill off as many creatures as you can during that time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2329160/extras/33e3a70040d48c0841bffc958acc0f1d.avif?t=1728637025\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survivors mode:</strong> Survive for 40 minutes as you fight relentless hordes consisting of hundreds and thousands of monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2329160/extras/abb81e9dcab36cf3e09b4d2f5754327a.avif?t=1728637025\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Infinite mode:</strong> Survive as long as you can while fighting relentless hordes of hundreds and thousands of monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2329160/extras/ffd44f650486fe6399a9afc5aec5ab49.avif?t=1728637025\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DYNAMIC BUILDS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different characters, cards and upgrades to choose from, no two attempts will ever be the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2329160/extras/97f3614c63fe6d56918268c75cb1b999.avif?t=1728637025\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ENDLESS REPLAYABILITY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cards and Guns offers endless replayability! Test your skills and improve your score!</p>",
